    procedure: '''Plan the activity using a source–pathway–receptor review. Identify sensitive drains, soil, groundwater and receiving waters; install prevention and containment before work; brief workers; inspect controls at the defined frequency and after changes or incidents; monitor where approval or risk assessment requires; stop the release pathway if controls fail; investigate deviations, implement corrective action and verify effectiveness before close-out.''',
    documents: '''Environmental Management Plan; aspect/impact and risk registers; applicable permits/NOCs; method statement; inspection records; monitoring plan and laboratory reports where required; contractor approvals; waste transfer/disposal evidence; incident and corrective-action records. For each item, confirm whether it is authority-mandated, permit-conditioned, project-required or recommended.''',
